# Replace host, secrets and observed IDs locally. These are placeholders, not a deployed sandbox.
@base = https://PUBLIC_SITE_HOST/api/public-site/v1
@submit = SUBMISSION_TOKEN
@studio = STUDIO_TOKEN
@payment = VERIFIED_ADAPTER_TOKEN
@scanner = SCANNER_TOKEN
@id = OBSERVED_INTAKE_UUID
@revision = 1
@attachment = OBSERVED_ATTACHMENT_UUID
@gallery = OBSERVED_PUBLICATION_UUID
@version = OBSERVED_VERSION_UUID

### Submit a booking with the body in booking-example.json
POST {{base}}/intakes
Authorization: Bearer {{submit}}
Idempotency-Key: external-booking-001
Content-Type: application/json

< booking-example.json

### Submit an inquiry
POST {{base}}/intakes
Authorization: Bearer {{submit}}
Idempotency-Key: external-inquiry-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"Inquiry","clientName":"Test Client","clientEmail":"test@example.invalid","notes":"Please quote a graduation session."}

### Read your intake status
GET {{base}}/intakes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{submit}}

### Status alias
GET {{base}}/intakes/{{id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{submit}}

### Poll first page; next request passes ?cursor=OBSERVED_NEXT_CURSOR
GET {{base}}/changes
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}

### Acknowledge only after durable Studio save
POST {{base}}/intakes/{{id}}/ack
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":1,"reviewStatus":"AwaitingReview","acknowledgmentStatus":"Queued"}

### Replace roster using the exact current intake revision
PUT {{base}}/intakes/{{id}}/roster
Authorization: Bearer {{submit}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":1,"rows":[{"name":"Student","reference":"student-1","collection":"Class A","pickupNotification":"None"}]}

### Upload to quarantine; substitute actual base64 PDF/JPEG/PNG bytes
POST {{base}}/intakes/{{id}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{submit}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fileName":"document.pdf","contentBase64":"REPLACE_WITH_FILE_BYTES"}

### Fetch only after the scanner marks the file Clean
GET {{base}}/attachments/{{attachment}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}

### Rescan after scanner recovery
POST {{base}}/attachments/{{attachment}}/rescan
Authorization: Bearer {{scanner}}

### Verified adapter event; never use a client success-page claim
POST {{base}}/intakes/{{id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{payment}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"provider-event-1","provider":"TEST_ADAPTER","transactionReference":"capture-1","kind":"Deposit","amountMinor":10000,"currency":"JMD","occurredAtUtc":"2026-10-20T18:00:00Z"}

### Stage gallery metadata using actual UUIDs
POST {{base}}/galleries
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","clientId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","title":"Test gallery","finalDeliveryAvailable":true,"items":[{"versionId":"33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333","fileName":"portrait.jpg"}]}

### Upload pinned image bytes
PUT {{base}}/galleries/{{gallery}}/media/{{version}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< portrait.jpg

### Activate after every item upload
POST {{base}}/galleries/{{gallery}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Revoke
POST {{base}}/galleries/{{gallery}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{studio}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
